---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';

import {
	SITE_DESCRIPTION,
	SITE_TITLE
} from '../consts';
---


<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">


<head>

	<BaseHead
		title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
		description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}
	/>

</head>



<body>


<Header />



<main>



<section>


<h1>
	About Neo
</h1>



<h2>
	Build systems.<br />
	Learn continuously.<br />
	Think clearly.
</h2>



<p>
	Neo Blog is a personal knowledge system
	for recording learning, experiments,
	and ideas over time.
</p>


</section>





<section>


<h2>
	Why I Build This Blog
</h2>



<p>
	This blog is not only a place to publish articles.
</p>


<p>
	It is a system to record:
</p>



<ul>

	<li>
		What I learn
	</li>


	<li>
		What I build
	</li>


	<li>
		What I think
	</li>


	<li>
		What I discover through experiments
	</li>

</ul>


</section>







<section>


<h2>
	Three Directions
</h2>



<h3>
	📈 Trading
</h3>


<p>
	Recording trading journals,
	market observations,
	strategy experiments,
	and lessons learned.
</p>




<h3>
	🌱 Life
</h3>


<p>
	Exploring Career Lab,
	Home Lab,
	Life OS,
	and personal growth systems.
</p>




<h3>
	💡 Ideas
</h3>


<p>
	Writing about technology,
	business,
	systems,
	and observations.
</p>



</section>








<section>


<h2>
	Current Experiments
</h2>



<ul>


<li>

<strong>
Career Lab
</strong>

<br />

Exploring career direction,
skills,
and future opportunities.

</li>



<li>

<strong>
Home Lab
</strong>

<br />

Building practical skills
in systems,
automation,
and technology.

</li>



<li>

<strong>
Life OS
</strong>

<br />

Designing personal systems
for learning,
health,
and productivity.

</li>



</ul>


</section>







<section>


<h2>
	Principles
</h2>



<ul>


<li>
Think long term.
</li>


<li>
Build systems instead of relying on motivation.
</li>


<li>
Learn through experiments.
</li>


<li>
Keep improving through consistency.
</li>


</ul>


</section>




</main>




<Footer />


</body>

</html>





<style>


main {

	width:
		calc(100% - 2em);


	max-width:
		720px;


	margin:
		auto;


	padding:
		3rem 0;

}



section {

	padding:
		1.5rem 0;

}



h1 {

	margin-bottom:
		1.5rem;

}



h2 {

	margin-top:
		2rem;

}



h3 {

	margin-top:
		1.5rem;

}



p {

	line-height:
		1.7;

	color:
		rgb(var(--gray-dark));

}



li {

	margin-bottom:
		0.8rem;


	line-height:
		1.6;

}


</style>